	(text "Arduino Pro Micro (ATmega32U4) - steno key matrix\nCOL2ROW: diodes point column -> row. Rows driven LOW one at a time;\ncolumns read with INPUT_PULLUP, LOW = pressed.\nPins: Left:  r1=D1(TX), r2=D0(RX), r3=D9, c1=D4, c2=D5, c3=D6, c4=D7, c5=D8\nRight: r4=D21, r5=D20, r6=D10, c6=D19, c7=D18, c8=D15, c9=D14, c10=D16\nOLED 128x32 SSD1306 (I2C addr 0x3C): SDA=D2, SCL=D3"
